  "details": "Affected avatar (Private)\n\navtr_ddf6704e-bfb2-4c04-b8fc-1a8483876073\n\n1. Load into avatar and enable Clothing/Select Clothing/Shirts/Mips Shirt\n\n2. Switch out and then back into avatar\n\n3. Have an observer join\n\n4. Enable Clothing/Select Clothing/Haku (which disables the other outfit)\n\nLocal will see the outfit switch to the Haku, remote (the observer) will see both outfits remain enabled.\n\nNotably, this avatar worked fine in live until I copied the native face tracking setup from another avatar.\n\nI have heard reports of my toggles breaking like this in other worlds, but the world I tested in was https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_3641b8d9-04da-4ee4-8b06-966ca097b1a3",
